  "caption": "Rovers, roll out.\n \nIn test halls across the region, the next batch of small survey rovers is coming together.\n \nFrom @examplerobotics and @sample_avionics to @demo_propulsion and @testbed_labs_, we're taking you behind the scenes to see the hardware that will carry Orbit Lab instruments to the crater rim — one step closer to a permanent research camp.\n \nVisit the link in our bio to watch the full video and follow the build.\n \nCredit: Orbit Lab\n \n#OrbitLab #Rovers #Exploration #Science",
