  "isAvailable": true,
  "caption": "The official Example Cup match ball went to orbit 🛰️⚽️ \n\nMatch balls need to fly predictably, so sports engineers carefully measure and tune their center of mass and balance. This year, the @stationdaily crew repeated an older experiment with this season's ball to show the effect of good and bad balance in footballs. The results help explain how embedded tech, like match-ball sensors, can change how a ball behaves in play. Improving the beautiful game is just one of the ways research done by Orbit Lab in orbit makes life better for people on the ground.",
